    "created_at": "2019-07-02T05:28:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-07-02T05:28:13Z",
    "body": "I don't think we're likely to add callback-based APIs. Eliminating the promise from the external API wouldn't eliminate the promise returned from pull(), nor the other objects that are created internally. The objective of \"zero garbage\" isn't achievable without engine heroics anyway, so I don't see a compelling reason to add APIs that don't align with the rest of the standard.",
